  "goodToKnow": "Der Wohnungsbau is housing construction: der soziale Wohnungsbau (social housing), Wohnungsbau fördern. Germany's government set a target of 400,000 new homes a year from 2021, but actual completions fell well short because of high interest rates and building costs. To rent a Sozialwohnung, you need a Wohnberechtigungsschein (WBS), based on income. Most Germans rent rather than own. It has no plural."
